## 5. Target realization rules

Target syntax stays out of the source semantic decision: `prepare` returns a
plan and `render` produces text. Conversion form is `toMutableArray()`; the
corrected single-wrap form is `X.toMutableArray()` (not
`TiqianArray(X.toMutableArray())`).

